Package: teleprompter-pro
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         python3 (>= 3.10),
         python3-pyqt6,
         python3-flask,
         python3-flask-socketio,
         python3-qrcode,
         python3-vosk,
         python3-sounddevice
Recommends: teleprompter-pro-model-es
Description: Desktop teleprompter with projects, camera pipeline and remote control
 Teleprompter Pro is a desktop teleprompter designed for real-world
 presentation and recording workflows. The computer reads the script
 while the user records video.
 .
 Features include:
  * Project-based workflow (.bigprompt folders) with script editor
  * Six starter script templates (tutorial, presentation, class…)
  * Import of .txt, .md, .html and .docx scripts
  * Countdown 3-2-1 before scroll starts
  * Progress bar with estimated time remaining
  * Remote control from phone via QR code and WebSocket
  * Voice synchronization using Vosk (adjusts speed to speaker)
  * Multiple speed controls (keyboard, mouse wheel, touch)
  * Guide line for eye focus and real mirror mode
  * Persistent configuration per platform (XDG on Linux)
  * PyQt6 modern interface, translatable with Qt Linguist

Package: teleprompter-pro-model-es
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         teleprompter-pro
Description: Spanish speech recognition model for Teleprompter Pro
 This package contains the Vosk Spanish language model required for
 the voice synchronization feature of Teleprompter Pro.
 .
 The model enables local speech recognition without internet access,
 allowing the teleprompter to automatically adjust scroll speed
 based on the speaker's pace.
